{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.gyudon",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "收工很晚，她说想吃牛丼",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.gyudon",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyuki.gyudon",
    "idolId": "chiyuki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天也弄到这么晚，抱歉啊千雪。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不会。制作人先生才是，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "马上送你回去。饿了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "没事。制作人先生才是，肚子不饿吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真敏锐……老实说，我也饿扁了……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，那要不要一起吃晚饭？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？连私人时间都……不太好吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不会～我也饿扁了嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是吗？那……千雪想吃什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "制作人先生本来打算吃什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我啊，与其说打算吃……就牛丼吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哇！牛丼！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "我想去牛丼店！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，不用，难得的机会我请你吃点贵一点的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不不，不行。已经决定是牛丼了。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可、可是……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，您的肚子在叫哦～",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "制作人先生的肚子也说想吃牛丼呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，真不好意思……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那，请带我去吧♪",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好！那，走吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "制作人先生，谢谢招待～",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，别在意。难得的机会却是快餐。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不过，今天的牛丼，总觉得比平时好吃。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哎呀……我也觉得非常好吃哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊，千雪这么说我就放心了。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "和别人一起吃，就会很开心，觉得很幸福……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "总觉得比平时放松。也许是托千雪的福。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，哪里……制作人先生，最近很累吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没、没有那种事。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "真是的……那种程度，我看得出来哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "您总是为了我们跑来跑去……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……如果有什么我能做的，请什么都告诉我哦。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "你什么都不用做。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "能看到你的笑容就够了。",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "帮我治治疲劳吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天也是为了让我早点吃饭，你才费心的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不，哪里……说自己能做什么，太自大了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不过……如果您愿意让我待在一旁，我会很高兴的。"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "笑容……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对。今天能一起吃饭，看到那个笑容，就够我撑一阵子了。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哎呀……那我得一直笑着才行呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不过……一直笑着，会有点累的哦？"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "治疲劳……？",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "开玩笑的。不过，千雪在的话，感觉真能治好。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，那就让我来当那个药吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……不过，不准勉强哦。"
      }
    }
  },
